menu "Controller USB Local (NCM + ADB bridge)"

    config CONTROLLER_USB_LOCAL
        bool "Enable USB local network bridge (NCM 192.168.77.0/24 + ADB 5555 ticket gate)"
        default n
        help
            Port of the epaper-lineage USB local net + ADB bridge.
            Needs CONFIG_TINYUSB_NET_MODE_NCM=y from esp_tinyusb.
            Build variant: idf.py -B build-usb-local -D SDKCONFIG_DEFAULTS="sdkconfig.defaults;sdkconfig.usb-local.defaults"

endmenu
